WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.300
The Hall — a white colonnade recedes behind the glass; as the viewer's head drifts, near columns sweep past far ones.

00:06.300 --> 00:13.800
The window slides down a floor into the Resonance Room — hundreds of strings of light vibrate to the score.

00:13.800 --> 00:21.300
The Storm Sill — cloud banks at dusk, lightning deep in the stack, rain beading on the glass itself.

00:21.300 --> 00:30.000
The Vault — glowing artifacts in cases at staggered depths; one coin of light floats in front of the pane.
